<p>Each shorter companion article names, at its start, the section of the longer article it assumes, so a reader arriving with a task can fill a precise gap without reading the whole route. <a href={`${base}/choosing/`}>Choosing a relational database</a> develops the decision in this section: <a href={`${base}/choosing/#establish-whether-a-relational-system-fits`}>whether a relational system fits</a>, <a href={`${base}/choosing/#choose-the-process-and-failure-boundary`}>choosing the process and failure boundary</a> and <a href={`${base}/choosing/#test-the-candidates-against-the-same-application`}>testing candidates against the same application</a>.</p>

